METHOD 1. Ambrish Roy, Alper Kucukural, Yang Zhang. I-TASSER: a unified
METHOD    platform for automated protein structure and function prediction.
METHOD    Nature Protocols, vol 5, 725-738 (2010). 
METHOD 2. Yang Zhang. I-TASSER server for protein 3D structure prediction. 
METHOD    BMC Bioinformatics, 9:40 (2008).
